      "date": "2026-04-27T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Samvardhana Motherson International Limited (BSE:517334) agreed to acquire 51% stake in Nissin Advanced Coating Indo Co. Private Limited from Nissin Electric Co., Ltd. for INR 92.3 million.",
      "body": "Samvardhana Motherson International Limited (BSE:517334) agreed to acquire 51% stake in Nissin Advanced Coating Indo Co. Private Limited from Nissin Electric Co., Ltd. for INR 92.3 million on April 27, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 92.3 million will be paid by Samvardhana Motherson International Limited. As part of consideration, INR 92.3 million is paid towards common equity of Nissin Advanced Coating Indo Co. Private Limited. Board of Samvardhana Motherson International Limited approved the acquisition.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2026, Nissin Advanced Coating Indo Co. Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 300.4 million and EBITDA of INR 100.3 million.\n\nThe expected completion of the transaction is April 27, 2026 to June 30, 2026.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "80",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
